[
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500010"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]碧卡拉以蘭德索爾為據點活動後，過了段時間的某天──",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n當她走在街上時，發現了一個舉止可疑的身影。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]人……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_000",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n人比平時多好多啊……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]很久沒來蘭德索爾看看，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_001",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n沒想到現在竟然在舉辦跳蚤市場……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]嗚嗚……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]人多到不行，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這根本不是大都會，是超都會吧……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]嗨，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_002",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]那邊的女孩！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]妳是不是有什麼困擾呢？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]呀啊！？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_003",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]對對對對不起！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_004",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我這種邊緣人還擋在路上根本太得意忘形了對吧……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]來來，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]還請前進吧～！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n我會移動去道路邊邊的，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]沒事沒事～！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]哈哈！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_005",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n妳也用不著倒退那麼多步吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]別擔心，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]妳並沒有擋到其他人走路唷♪",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]是不是我突然出聲搭話，嚇到妳了呢？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_006",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我的名字是碧卡拉！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]可以叫我碧奇就好，我會很開心的♪",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我不是什麼可疑人士，請放心吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]可可可、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_007",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]可疑人士什麼的，怎麼會呢！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n我沒有在想那麼失禮的事啦！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]倒不如說，我的可疑程度才是突破天際呀！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]哈哈！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_008",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n還請別說",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]自己很可疑這種話喔。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]妳看上去就是一位很美好的女孩子呀！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]美、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_009",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]美美美美好！？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]是在說誰？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n還是說",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這地方有我看不見的其他人在？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]一定是那樣！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]畢竟我這個人連美好的邊都沾不上嘛！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]當然是說妳，不然還會是誰呢？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_010",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]來吧，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]美好女孩！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n既然有緣在此相遇，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]就讓我們來個初次見面的握手吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_011",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_012",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這笑容是多麼開朗啊……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這份開朗",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]肯定是擁有100個朋友──",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]不，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]估算最少也是擁有10萬個朋友等級的光芒！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]不會錯的，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]這個人……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]一定超級受歡迎！　",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]來吧，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_013",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]不用客氣！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n在蘭德索爾的路旁，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]跟我握手吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]好、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_014",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]好的！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我知道了，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]都聽妳的……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]請等一下，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我要先擦一下冒了一大堆汗的手……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊啊，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]然後要整理一下儀容，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]再來還有就是…………！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]哈哈！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_015",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n用不著慌張，我不會逃跑的。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]所以可以慢慢……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉、碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊！！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_016",
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]好痛喔……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_017",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊啊，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]對不起！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n不小心撞到妳了……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]有沒有受傷──",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊…………",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_018",
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n啊、",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]耳朵不見了────！？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_019",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]對不起，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_020",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]是剛才撞到的關係吧！？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n因為受到衝撞，老鼠耳朵因此被撞掉然後粉碎接著隨風消逝了對吧！？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我也沒想到自己竟然潛藏著這種力量啊～！！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]呃、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_021",
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]啊、",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]不、",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]不是……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]老鼠耳朵、",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]只只",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]只是掉了而已……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125612
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]唔！？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118071_022",
    "unit_id": 104011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]碧卡拉的情緒似乎變得有點低落……",
